            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. As it relates to a work related injury, the Employee will have their attending physician provide to the Employer a written prognosis and date for the Employee's return to full, restricted or light duty. If the treating physician indicates an Employee is physically able to return to work of any kind, and such work is available, the Employee will be notified to report for duty the workday following the physician's determination. An Employee is to be advised that refusing to return to work when ordered could result in overpayment and/or AWOL.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
