        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. A reasonable amount of time, not to exceed 10 minutes, at the beginning of shift, before lunch, and at the end of the work shift will be allowed for personal and work area clean-up for Employees whose work requires the wear of coveralls and handling of hazardous materials. PPE and coveralls will not be worn in the lunch room or designated indoor break areas.",
            "block_bbox": [
